\label{lemma-hom-into-depth}
Let $R$ be a Noetherian local ring. Let $M$, $N$ be finite $R$-modules.
\begin{enumerate}
\item If $N$ has depth $\geq 1$, then $\Hom_R(M, N)$ has depth $\geq 1$.
\item If $N$ has depth $\geq 2$, then $\Hom_R(M, N)$ has depth $\geq 2$.
\end{enumerate}

